    "jobDescription": "<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"></p><ul></ul><div style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial;\"><b>Job Description:</b></span></font></div><div style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial;\">As an Executive in the Accounts Receivable department, your primary responsibility will be to manage and oversee the&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\">timely collection of payments from customers, ensuring that the company's outstanding invoices are processed and settled&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\">efficiently. You will work closely with the Accounts Receivable team and report to the Finance Manager.</span></div><div style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><b><br></b></span></font></div><div style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial;\"><b>Key Responsibilities:</b></span></font></div><div style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><b><br></b></span></font></div><ul><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\">Prepare and report Daily cash /online transactions reconciliation.&nbsp;</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12px;\">Follow up and highlight any discrepancies w.r.t to reconciliation to relevant stakeholders.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12px;\">Coordinate with channel partners, banks and internal stakeholders to resolve issues on a timely manner.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12px;\">Prepare reconciliation of collection made from 3PLs with Bank statements.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial;\">Monitor and record customer payments received through various channels, such as electronic transfers, and&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\">credit card payments. Reconcile payments with the corresponding invoices and update the accounting system&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\">accordingly.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial;\">Regularly review the accounts receivable aging report to identify overdue accounts and take appropriate&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\">actions to expedite payments. Prioritize collection efforts based on the aging of outstanding invoices.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12px;\">Assist with month-end closure activities as required.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 12px;\">Identify opportunities to streamline and improve processes and automate everywhere required.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial;\">Ensure compliance with company policies and procedures, as well as relevant accounting standards and&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial;\">regulations, during the entire accounts receivable process</span></li></ul><div style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><b><br></b></span></font></div><div style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial;\"><b>Requirements:</b></span></font></div><div style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><b><br></b></span></font></div><ul><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-fami