ize: 12px; font-family: Arial;\">Proficiency in MS Excel (VLOOKUP, Pivot Tables, etc.).</span></font></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial;\">Bachelor’s degree in finance, Accounting, or a related field is preferred.</span></font></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 7px; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial;\">Working knowledge in SAP</span></font></li></ul>",
